==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{m|enm|humidite|}}, from {{etyl|fro|en}}, from {{etyl|ML.|en}} {{m|la|humiditas}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|umidus||damp, moist, wet}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|humidities}}

# [[dampness]], especially that of the [[air]].
# the [[amount]] of [[water]] [[vapour]] in the air.

====Derived terms====
* [[absolute humidity]]
* [[relative humidity]]
* [[specific humidity]]

====Related terms====
* [[humid]]
* [[humidifier]]
* [[humidify]]

====See also====
* [[dew point]]
* [[hygrometer]]

